  ($str$variable$str$, 'USA', $str$2026-TransferDie$str$, $str$minCamIntersectDistance1$str$, $str$40$str$, $str$Length$str$, $str$One of several distance thresholds used to determine if a cam pierced hole intersects with a direct pierced hole. If the projected cam pierced hole intersects with the projected direct pierced hole within this distance then the cam pierced hole is considered to have intersected with the direct pierced hole.$str$, $jsonb${"Variable Name":"minCamIntersectDistance1","String Value":40,"Unit Type Name":"Length","Notes":"One of several distance thresholds used to determine if a cam pierced hole intersects with a direct pierced hole. If the projected cam pierced hole intersects with the projected direct pierced hole within this distance then the cam pierced hole is considered to have intersected with the direct pierced hole.","Applies To":"Transfer Die (component/cam - inferred)"}$jsonb$::jsonb),
